#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya {#overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Quantum Portfolio Optimizer is a Quantum Function that tackles the dynamic portfolio optimization problem, a standard problem in finance that aims to rebalance periodic investments across a set of assets, to maximize returns and minimize risks. By deploying cutting-edge quantum optimization techniques, this function simplifies the process so that users, with no expertise in quantum computing, can benefit from its advantages in finding optimal investment trajectories. Ideal for portfolio managers, researchers in quantitative finance, and individual investors, this tool enables back-testing of trading strategies in portfolio optimization.\n"
msgstr "Ang Quantum Portfolio Optimizer ay isang Quantum Function na tumutugon sa dynamic portfolio optimization na problema — isang karaniwang problema sa pananalapi na naglalayong muling i-balance ang mga pana-panahong pamumuhunan sa iba't ibang asset upang mapakinabangan ang kita at mabawasan ang panganib. Sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng pinakabagong mga teknik sa quantum optimization, pinapasimple ng function na ito ang proseso para makinabang ang mga gumagamit — kahit walang kaalaman sa quantum computing — mula sa mga kalamangan nito sa paghanap ng pinakamainam na mga trajectory ng pamumuhunan. Perpekto para sa mga portfolio manager, mananaliksik sa quantitative finance, at mga indibidwal na mamumuhunan, pinapahintulutan ng tool na ito ang back-testing ng mga trading strategy sa portfolio optimization.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function description {#function-description}"
msgstr "Paglalarawan ng function {#function-description}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Quantum Portfolio Optimizer function uses the Variational Quantum Eigensolver (VQE) algorithm to solve a Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization (QUBO) problem, addressing dynamic portfolio optimization problems. Users simply need to provide the asset price data and define the investment constraint, then the function runs the quantum optimization process that returns a set of optimized investment trajectories.\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit ng Quantum Portfolio Optimizer function ang Variational Quantum Eigensolver (VQE) algorithm para malutas ang Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization (QUBO) na problema, na tumutugon sa mga dynamic portfolio optimization na problema. Kailangan lamang ng mga gumagamit na ibigay ang datos ng presyo ng asset at tukuyin ang constraint ng pamumuhunan, pagkatapos ay pinapatakbo ng function ang proseso ng quantum optimization na nagbabalik ng isang set ng mga na-optimize na trajectory ng pamumuhunan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The process consists of four main stages. First, the input data is mapped to a quantum-compatible problem, constructing the QUBO of the dynamic portfolio optimization problem, and transforming it into a quantum operator (Ising Hamiltonian). Next, the input problem and the VQE algorithm are adapted to be run in the quantum hardware. The VQE algorithm is then run on the quantum hardware, and finally, the results are post-processed to provide the optimal investment trajectories. The system also includes a noise-aware ([SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd)-based) post-processing to maximize the quality of the output.\n"
msgstr "Ang proseso ay binubuo ng apat na pangunahing yugto. Una, ang input data ay imi-map sa isang quantum-compatible na problema, itinatayo ang QUBO ng dynamic portfolio optimization na problema, at binabago ito sa isang quantum operator (Ising Hamiltonian). Susunod, ang input na problema at ang VQE algorithm ay ina-adapt para patakbuhin sa quantum hardware. Pagkatapos ay pinapatakbo ang VQE algorithm sa quantum hardware, at sa wakas, ang mga resulta ay pinoproseso upang maibigay ang pinakamainam na mga trajectory ng pamumuhunan. Kasama rin sa sistema ang isang noise-aware ([SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd)-based) na post-processing upang mapakinabangan ang kalidad ng output.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This Quantum Function is based on the [published manuscript](https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19150) by Global Data Quantum.\n"
"![Visualization of the workflow of the function](/docs/images/guides/global-data-quantum-optimizer/function_workflow.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Quantum Function na ito ay batay sa [nailathala na manuskrito](https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19150) ng Global Data Quantum.\n"
"![Visualization ng workflow ng function](/docs/images/guides/global-data-quantum-optimizer/function_workflow.svg)\n"

